    add("log_revenue_ncaer_cost",lambda k:_d(k,REVENUE,["FY 2023-24 estimate"],[{"label":"Current-price estimate","values":[24.01]}],LOGISTICS_COST,"Rs lakh crore","DPIIT / NCAER Report on Logistics Cost Assessment in India (2025): total logistics cost estimated at Rs 24.01 lakh crore at current prices for FY 2023-24. This is cost, not revenue or market size.","Estimated National Logistics Cost","Current-price estimate, FY 2023-24","#ff7b72","NCAER's estimated aggregate logistics cost at current prices.","The report estimates Rs 24.01 lakh crore, equal to 7.97% of GDP in FY 2023-24.","Distinguishes a documented cost estimate from unsupported market-size claims.","bar"))

